{"version":1,"content":"<p>TALK Hong Kong今（20日）舉辦新聞發布會，發表委託香港大學的研究報告《香港兒童性侵犯罪行判刑（1990-2025）：司法理據之實證分析及加強保護兒童之建議》。</p><p>報告指，法庭判刑持續偏輕，加刑因素比重不一致，倡議設立「判刑委員會」；</p><p>為從源頭預防兒童性侵犯，TALK Hong Kong新推出「Stop It Now HK」平台，協助可能傷害兒童的人士，希望從源頭預防。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:04.410189+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:13:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T02:57:43.427519+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684168+00:00","content_hash":"939dc6b9c9f1d963d3533894eabdfd60727bd913f28e119d3fc3abe0b54e2da7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}